iginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2dAd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3cad021-e6cc-42ce-9b93-ebb1f314ea40","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"プライベートで使ってるのをめっちゃ厳しくしてるからっていうのがあるけど、書いてて不安になることが割と","ts":"1629794109.085900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y79"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1a4f846-73da-4568-858f-cedb9193c393","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Deno、ビルド済みバイナリの配布を見据えるとちょっと辛い気がしてる\nまあ `go get` と同じ感じで運用するなら変わりないか","ts":"1629794088.085200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vv8n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cb8dccc-02c5-401d-bbac-4031ef9576b7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deno lintが緩いのは分かる","ts":"1629794070.084400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cQwQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"891089a2-fb42-4117-9b45-a928ea2514be","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"polyfill系の話題を思いだす\n\u003chttps://yosuke-furukawa.hatenablog.com/entry/2016/03/27/152500\u003e","ts":"1629794067.084300","attachments":[{"fallback":"from scratch: JavaScriptの文化とleftpadの話とpadStartについて - from scratch","id":1,"title":"JavaScriptの文化とleftpadの話とpadStartについて - from scratch","title_link":"https://yosuke-furukawa.hatenablog.com/entry/2016/03/27/152500","text":"無駄にラノベみたいに長いタイトル書いちゃったんですが、まぁやっぱり一言くらいは残しておくかと思ったので書きます。長いのでまとめだけでも見てもらえると良いかもしれません。leftpadの話はかなり大事になっていて、Node.js界隈を中心としてその他のOSSをやっている全体的に話が波及しています。幾つかの記事を読みました。今回はJSの文化と歴史についてちょっとずつ書いていこうかなと思います。本の虫: npmからkikとその他諸々が消されたまとめ江添さんの話はすごくよくまとまっていて、ネタも含めた上で一番面白い話になっていました、ここで言われている下記の疑問に答えていこうと思います。 もっと憂うべ…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/12704346814673855811/10328537792368672237/1459091180","blocks":null,"ts":1459059900,"service_name":"from scratch","service_icon":"https://yosuke-furukawa.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://yosuke-furukawa.hatenablog.com/entry/2016/03/27/152500","original_url":"https://yosuke-furukawa.hatenablog.com/entry/2016/03/27/152500"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/LV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a41c9138-73dd-4444-bf91-f67b0347a465","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"でもゆるゆるな deno lint も怖い。","ts":"1629794060.083800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0FlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9897df2-cf8a-4198-b62e-5d2bd381f7ea","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"実際使おうと思ったら `zero-config「zero-config とは言っていない」` みたいな感じだったりするけど。。。","ts":"1629794049.083500","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1629794057.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5099342d-7512-4ed9-80e0-572a0c6e4596","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"eslintの設定とか死ぬほど辛い","ts":"1629794032.082700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0FgZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c0e983b-b308-4eb3-882e-25166e390f30","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"結果組み合わせるのが難しくなってる現状があるみたいな感じに思います。その揺り戻しで zero config なツールとかも出てきてますが。","ts":"1629793998.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LMrXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3719c61a-38a0-49fe-8de0-fcc456f05a04","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"すべてカスタマイズできる。ミニマムな機能を持ったツールを組み合わせてアプリを作る。みたいな思想が最初期からずっと node 界隈には根強くて","ts":"1629793968.080100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3H9gm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45c4a232-4980-4010-8623-499a788a7e76","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そそ。","ts":"1629793937.079000","team":